{
 "unidades": [
  {
   "id": "u06",
   "titulo": {
    "es": "Consonantes nuevas",
    "en": "New consonants"
   },
   "objetivo": {
    "es": "Leer ch y j, la s que zumba y la ss, v y b, c y ç, gu, qu, la h muda y ph.",
    "en": "Read ch and j, the buzzing s and ss, v and b, c and ç, gu, qu, silent h and ph."
   },
   "lecciones": [
    {
     "id": "u06.l01",
     "titulo": {
      "es": "ch y j",
      "en": "ch and j"
     },
     "pasos": [
      {
       "tipo": "lumo",
       "pose": "anima",
       "texto": {
        "es": "El francés tiene consonantes nuevas para ti. Hoy, dos sonidos parecidos: ch y j.",
        "en": "Today, two French consonants that look new but sound familiar: ch and j."
       }
      },
      {
       "tipo": "mira",
       "m": "(ch:=)(a:a)(t:_)",
       "texto": {
        "es": "Ch suena como cuando pides silencio: shhh. Así empieza chat (gato).",
        "en": "Ch sounds like English sh: shhh. That's how chat (cat) begins."
       }
      },
      {
       "tipo": "escucha",
       "palabras": [
        {
         "m": "(ch:=)(a:a)(t:_)",
         "e": "1f431",
         "t": {
          "es": "gato",
          "en": "cat"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "v(a:a)(ch:=)(e:_)",
         "e": "1f404",
         "t": {
          "es": "vaca",
          "en": "cow"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "b(ou:ou)(ch:=)(e:_)",
         "e": "1f444",
         "t": {
          "es": "boca",
          "en": "mouth"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "(ch:=)(o:oo)c(o:oo)l(a:a)(t:_)",
         "e": "1f36b",
         "t": {
          "es": "chocolate",
          "en": "chocolate"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "tipo": "mira",
       "m": "j(u:u)p(e:_)",
       "texto": {
        "es": "La j es ese mismo «sh», pero con voz: la garganta vibra. La g antes de e o i suena igual: girafe, rouge.",
        "en": "J is that sh with your voice on, like the s in measure. G before e or i sounds the same: girafe, rouge."
       }
      },
      {
       "tipo": "escucha",
       "palabras": [
        {
         "m": "j(u:u)p(e:_)",
         "t": {
          "es": "falda",
          "en": "skirt"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "j(eu:eu)",
         "e": "1f3ae",
         "t": {
          "es": "juego",
          "en": "game"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "g(i:i)r(a:a)f(e:_)",
         "e": "1f992",
         "t": {
          "es": "jirafa",
          "en": "giraffe"
         }
        },
        {
         "m": "r(ou:ou)g(e:_)",
         "e": "1f534",
         "t": {
          "es": "rojo, roja",
          "en": "red"
         }
        }
